        "facts_html": "<div class=\"gl-facts\"><table class=\"gl-facts__table\"><caption>Supplement Facts</caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Serving Size 2 Capsules<br>Servings Per Container: 60</th><th scope=\"col\">Amount Per Serving</th><th scope=\"col\">% Daily Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Vitamin B-6 (as pyridoxine HCl)</th><td>10 mg</td><td>588%</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Folate</th><td>670 mcg DFE<br>(400 mcg folic acid)</td><td>167%</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Biotin</th><td>300 mcg</td><td>1,000%</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Pantothenic Acid (as calcium d-pantothenate)</th><td>300 mg</td><td>6,000%</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Zinc (as zinc oxide)</th><td>10 mg</td><td>91%</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Copper (as cupric oxide)</th><td>1 mg</td><td>111%</td></tr></tbody><tbody class=\"gl-facts__group\"><tr><th scope=\"row\">Brand Name Proprietary Blend<span class=\"gl-facts__parts\">Consisting of: Saw Palmetto Berries (45% extract), PABA (para-Aminobenzoic Acid), L-Tyrosine, Horsetail Aerial Parts (7% extract), Plant Sterol Complex (38-45% beta-sitosterol), Stinging Nettle Root 4:1 Extract, Catalase Complex, Chlorella Extract (2% chlorophyll), Fo-Ti Root Powder, Barley Grass Juice Powder.</span></th><td>1,124.3 mg</td><td>*</td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"gl-facts__note\">*Daily Value not established.</p><p><strong>Other ingredients:</strong> Gelatin (bovine), vegetable magnesium stearate, and silicon dioxide.</p><p><strong>Allergen warning:</strong> Contains soy and wheat (barley grass).</p></div>",
